<x-layouts.public title="Legal | afacere.online">
    <section class="hero"><p class="muted">Legal</p><h1>Privacy, terms and responsible product use.</h1><p class="lead">The public site does not expose private business information. Authenticated workflows are protected by authentication, business-context authorization and server-side entitlements.</p></section>
    <h2>Privacy</h2><p>Only information required to provide the product should be collected and retained. Business information is scoped to authorized users and businesses. Account data can be exported through the authenticated data export endpoint, and users can submit a deletion request through their account.</p>
    <h2>Deletion and retention</h2><p>Deletion requests are reviewed before execution. Eligible account data, sole-member businesses, user-owned documents and associated storage objects are removed. Shared businesses remain available to their other members. Financial and security records may be retained where required for reconciliation, accounting or accountability, with direct user references removed where technically appropriate.</p>
    <h2>Terms</h2><p>afacere.online provides decision-support and execution tooling. Entrepreneurs remain responsible for their business decisions and actions.</p>
    <h2>AI-assisted features</h2><p>AI output is treated as assistance and must not be relied upon as a substitute for professional, legal, financial or other specialist advice.</p>
    <p class="muted">Retention defaults and detailed data-lifecycle behavior are documented in the repository. Final production privacy terms remain subject to jurisdiction-specific legal review.</p>
